The applix problem reminds me of mathematica. I guess applix helps itself
by adding its default fontdir to the X font path. The problem is that this
dir resides on the alpha. Just copy the fonts to the Sun, either in the
directory applix expects, or in a directory of your choice, if you are
willing to add it to the static fontpath on the Sun.


Reinier.





